"Build Accountable Status, a status page for the Accountable suite of apps. Every minute it checks each service's address and records whether it responded and how fast. The page shows each service with a row of 90 daily bars colored by uptime, a chart of response times and a list of incidents, which open when a service stops responding and close when it comes back. Start with one service, Accountable, running locally from ../accountable, beside this repo. Read its code there; don't copy it or change it. Fill a new database with 90 days of sample history so the page looks complete on the first run. Make the page look polished, following the brand skill. Use the tech stack in docs/TECH_STACK.md, which includes how to start and stop Accountable."
